  "quirks": [
    "Independent portable C/C++ headless adapter; monophonic four-oscillator synthesis with last-note priority.",
    "Original fixed-velocity amplitude retained; no polyphony or ROM requirement.",
    "Wave choices reflect DSP triangle/saw order, with no unimplemented wave 4.",
    "DSP filter history fixed and envelope time normalized from 44.1 kHz."
  ],
